{"id":"869fd5ec799a","path":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/contacts","lang":"en","title":"Contact us","description":"The Study Advisory Service is always available for information on USI's Degrees. Call us or send us an email today.","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Bachelor","BCOM"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9.jpg?itok=P92hDBzr","words":112,"alternates":{},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Bachelor","path":"/en/originalnode/328"},{"label":"BCOM","path":"/en/education/bachelor/communication"},{"label":"Contact us","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9.jpg?itok=P92hDBzr","alt":"orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9","caption":""}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>The Study Advisory Service is available for study orientation meetings and general information about the University.</p> <p>The service offers the following contact methods and schedules:</p> <ul> <li>Desk (Via Buffi 13, Lugano, office 320): Monday to Friday from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM and from 2:00 PM to 5:00 PM</li> <li>Phone +41 58 666 4795: available in the morning from Tuesday to Friday from 9:00 AM to 12:00 PM, and in the afternoon on Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday from 2:00 PM to 5:00 PM.</li> <li>Personalized consultations by appointment, available in person or remotely via Microsoft Teams, can be booked on <a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/book-a-meeting\">this webpage</a>.</li> </ul> <p>For general inquiries, you can fill out the form:</p> <p><strong><a href=\"https://join.usi.ch/en/contact-form\">Contact us</a></strong></p>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"},{"label":"Open Days","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/open-days-study-advisory"}],"nav":[{"label":"Bachelor in Communication","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication"},{"label":"Why Study Communication?","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/why-study-communication"},{"label":"Why Study Communication at USI?","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/why-study-communication/why-study-communication-at-usi"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/node/35553"},{"label":"Dual Choice","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/dual-choice"},{"label":"Continue the Studies with a Master’s","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/master-studies"},{"label":"Entering the Business World","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/career-prospects/career-prospects"},{"label":"Admission","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/admission"},{"label":"Fees and grants","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Practical information","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/organising-your-studies"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"/en/education/bachelor/communication/contacts"}],"links":[{"label":"Why USI","href":"/en/originalnode/327"},{"label":"Bachelor programmes","href":"/en/originalnode/328"},{"label":"Master programmes","href":"/en/originalnode/329"},{"label":"Application - Bachelor","href":"/en/originalnode/7159"},{"label":"Application - Master","href":"/en/originalnode/5729"},{"label":"Tuition and scholarships - Bachelor","href":"/en/originalnode/7166"},{"label":"Tuition and scholarships - Master","href":"/en/originalnode/7847"},{"label":"Open days","href":"/en/originalnode/7758"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/education/bachelor/communication/contacts","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:26:06.363Z"}